      ],
      "nextId": "hostility_medium_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "hostility_medium_002_rephrase",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "それなら待つ。言い直しは、壊れた空気を直す一歩になる。",
      "translatedText": "Then I will wait. Rephrasing can be the first step toward repairing the air.",
      "emotion": "steady",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "steady",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "hostility_medium_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "hostility_medium_002_minute",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "分かった。落ち着く時間を取って。戻るなら、普通の声で戻ってきて。",
      "translatedText": "Okay. Take a moment to cool down. If you come back, come back with a normal voice.",
      "emotion": "calm_firm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "calm",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
